  '["Bloquer 4h/jour de deep work qui se replanifient si urgence","Planifier 3 séances de sport/semaine sans y penser","Caser les 1:1s récurrents sans pingpong","Centraliser perso + pro pour ne plus doublebooker","Mesurer le temps réel passé par client/projet"]'::jsonb,
  '["Block 4h/day deep work","Plan 3 workouts/week","Recurring 1:1s without ping-pong","Centralize personal + work calendars","Track real time per project"]'::jsonb,
